See also |Button Shields| in Bridle and Zephyr sample:
:zephyr:code-sample:`button`.

   .. rubric:: On Hazard3 RISC-V (RV32IMAC+) with board revision ``@4mb`` (default)

   .. zephyr-app-commands::
      :app: zephyr/samples/basic/button
      :build-dir: mini_usb_rp2350
      :board: mini_usb_rp2350/rp2350a/hazard3_0
      :shield: "grove_btn_d16_inv grove_led_d17 grove_pwm_led_d17 x_grove_testbed"
      :west-args: -p
      :goals: flash
      :compact:

   .. rubric:: On ARM Cortex-M33 with board revision ``@4mb`` (default)

   .. zephyr-app-commands::
      :app: zephyr/samples/basic/button
      :build-dir: mini_usb_rp2350
      :board: mini_usb_rp2350/rp2350a/m33_0
      :shield: "grove_btn_d16_inv grove_led_d17 grove_pwm_led_d17 x_grove_testbed"
      :west-args: -p
      :goals: flash
      :compact:

You should see the following message on the console:

   .. admonition:: Console Output
      :class: note dropdown toggle-shown

      .. container:: highlight highlight-console notranslate

         .. parsed-literal::

            \*\*\* Booting Zephyr OS build |zephyr_version_em|\ *…*\*\*\*
            Press the button
            Button 34 pressed at 627381707
            Button 34 released at 663222919
            Button 34 pressed at 724110156
            Button 34 released at 748971710
            Button 34 pressed at 795448858
            Button 34 released at 821949208
            Button 34 pressed at 865947904
            Button 34 released at 891934399
            Button … … …
